<title>UK: UK's C&amp;W eases, euphoria over China subsides.</title>
<headline>UK's C&amp;W eases, euphoria over China subsides.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Britain's Cable and Wireless Plc eased 4-1/2 pence to 567-1/2 as initial euphoria over its deal with China Telecom subsided amid scepticism the partnership would not yield immediate results, dealers said.</p>
</text>
